  dialogue:
  - Ye feel that, lad?
  - That nice ocean breeze that ye can't git anywhere else.
  - It's hard to leave it behind.
  - If you say so, sir.
  - ...
  - What brings you to Sirius Light then, lad?
  - The pay is good.
  - Good enough to help reach a dream of mine.
  - I remember you bringing that up when being hired.
  - It would be best if you aim for something more stable.
  - Better than staying out here for the rest of my life.
  - What was that, lad?
  - I asked how many fish are we catching?
  - "\u2018ts what I thought."
